["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Isaacman: A New Era for NASA and American Space Exploration NEP MMRTG closed Brayton cycle TRL in-situ resource utilization\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-allin-nasa-局长-我们不是采购机构-是核动力-nasa/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/432889fb9b668f60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>NASA 局長：我們不是採購機構，是核動力 NASA</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Isaacman 說 NASA 過去把資源攤到每個選區、為合作而合作，結果月球火箭效率不如土星五號；他要做的是核動力與核推進，把近地軌道交給 SpaceX 這類公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">核動力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trying to Save the World Is No Excuse John Doe delta hedge BDC target date fund\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-moneystuff-想拯救世界-不是搞垄断协议的借口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>想拯救世界，不是搞壟斷協議的藉口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 實驗室想聯手放慢模型開發，但四家巨頭坐下來談減速，法律上就是教科書式的反壟斷合謀——想拯救世界不構成抗辯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 競賽</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of Startups in 2026 harness RL environments codegen system of record egocentric data\" href=\"/podc