alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>加州為了讓一個 24 歲博主閉嘴，專門立了一部法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州對調查者的反擊不是否認，而是立法：他一旦上傳拍到的畫面，先罰 4000 美元，再賠對方律師費。提出這部法的，是這個州總檢察長的妻子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加州高鐵</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"238. 特斯拉之後，汽車行業改變的不是動力，而是一整套遊戲規則丨串臺「Freda下午茶」 D2C DMS global consistency Tier 1 / Tier 2 VinFast\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-beiwanglu-特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动-而是重写了汽车业游戏规则/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"貝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">貝望錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉真正的顛覆不是電動，而是重寫了汽車業遊戲規則</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統車企不是沒看到特斯拉，而是把它當成細分市場的新玩具；真正被顛覆的是七年一改款的節奏、經銷商體系和供應鏈利益，這些包袱讓它們轉不了身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車出海</span><span class=\"tag\">新能源汽車</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"外灘大會線下圓桌｜敢把錢包交給AI嗎？聊聊Agent交易爆發前夜的信任基建 KYA Agentic Commerce Harness A2A Superbloom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-18-sv101-把钱包交给-ai-之前-支付网络得先重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">35:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把錢包交給 AI 之前，支付網絡得先重寫一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四位嘉賓裡只有一位真的用 Agent 付過錢，花了 40 多塊。萬事達卡說真正的卡點不在技術，而在讓普通消費者發自內心願意相信一個智能體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體支付</span><span class=\"tag\">信任基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Exxon’s Office Fling Jersey Standard dedicated word processor Directly Reduced Iron (DRI)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-asianometry-石油巨头去做打字机-做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f647fbb2223b0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>石油巨頭去做打字機，做到施樂那麼大也只是桶裡一滴油</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1978 年埃克森把文字處理器、智能打字機和傳真機合併成 Exxon Information Systems，去挑戰 IBM。它輸掉的不是技術，而是自己的體量：做到施樂那麼大，也只等於桶裡一滴油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業史</span><span class=\"tag\">多元化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"300 高市早苗支持率高位橫盤 內閣改組政壇進入多事之秋 Middle Power Japan&#x27;s back 中道\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-eastasia-冲绳变天不是亲中派落败-是年轻人认命要实惠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>沖繩變天不是親中派落敗，是年輕人認命要實惠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沖繩知事選舉，反對美軍基地的一方執政近二十年後敗選。這不是左右轉向，也不是對華態度變了：抗爭幾十年基地一步沒動，年輕選民認了命，先要眼前的經濟實惠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本政治</span><span class=\"tag\">高市早苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Roy Cohn Playbook, from McCarthyism to Trump McCarthyism closeted disbarred Teflon Don Angels in America\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-freshair-麦卡锡主义的操盘手-把打法传给了特朗普/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>麥卡錫主義的操盤手，把打法傳給了特朗普</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅伊·科恩不是麥卡錫時代的異類，而是美國民主每隔幾十年發作一次的偏執期的產物——這套打法沒有隨他死去，而是通過特朗普延續到了今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">麥卡錫主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"They Built the Quietest Place on Earth to Find Dark Matter look-elsewhere effect Sisyphean Index MSSI TPC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-intotheimpossi-暗物质探测跑得比摩尔定律还快-却只看到一个事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c7ba850b0a49087-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>暗物質探測跑得比摩爾定律還快，卻只看到一個事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LZ 用七噸液氙換來的那個核反衝事件，局部超過 3σ，算上 look-elsewhere effect 只剩 2.6σ——所以團隊必須一直說它可能只是背景漲落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物質</span><span class=\"tag\">液氙探測器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can ‘assisted migration’ save forests? And the role of philosophy in science assisted migration subalpine forest serotinous cones species rotation theory of mind comparative cognition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-sciencepod-把树往山上挪-救森林的赌注与代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/63261c5451f5f607-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>把樹往山上挪：救森林的賭注與代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高海拔火燒跡地裡，從低處移來的苗木八成到九成能活；但種子庫有限，把珍貴種源押在沒驗證的大規模種植上，本身就是一種冒險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生態修復</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Gravitational waveform modeling with physics informed neural networks and surrogates - Nils Deppe surrogate model physics informed neural network post-Newtonian mismatch co-orbital frame\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-17-instituteforad-用神经网络补后牛顿项-比纯数据驱动省一万倍训练量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf6ca6ea04b71b95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>用神經網絡補後牛頓項，比純數據驅動省一萬倍訓練量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純神經網絡波形模型要 10 的 8 次方到 10 的 10 次方條訓練數據，而把已知物理寫進網絡、只讓它學修正項，8 條數值相對論波形就夠了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">引力波</span><span class=\"tag\">數值相對論</span>\n</div></div></a>"]